PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  GlassPanel                 → TSGlassPanel (Sources/Components/UI/Cards.swift)
  DataTable<MonthlyBucket>   → TSDataTable<MonthlyCostBucket> (Sources/Components/UI/DataTable.swift): compact
                               density; sortable header menu (= web column controls); adaptive columnar(macOS/iPad)
                               / card(iPhone) layout. Rows arrive pre-sorted month/desc (web default) via the shared
                               stable TSTableSort; each column re-sortable via per-column comparator.
  Currency                   → TSCurrency (data-display) for the two plain precision-2 cells (cost → accent,
                               gasEquiv → statusDanger). The avg-rate (precision 3) + savings (signed '+') cells
                               need behaviour TSCurrency does not express, so they reuse the ported
                               MonthlyCostFormat.currency(precision:3) / .signedCurrency — the exact web
                               `precision={3}` / `{savings>=0?'+':''}` arithmetic.
  BarChart3 (lucide)         → SF Symbol "chart.bar.fill", tinted Color.TS.accent (web text-cyan-400).
